  "title": "Ekushe & national days",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "On **21 February 1952**, students in Dhaka were shot while demanding that **বাংলা** be a state language of Pakistan. Bangladesh remembers them on **একুশে ফেব্রুয়ারি** — **শহীদ দিবস** (Martyrs' Day). At dawn people walk barefoot to the **শহীদ মিনার** to lay flowers, singing *আমার ভাইয়ের রক্তে রাঙানো একুশে ফেব্রুয়ারি*. Since 1999 UNESCO marks the day worldwide as International **Mother Language** (মাতৃভাষা) Day.\n\nTwo more national days are public holidays (**ছুটি**):\n\n- **স্বাধীনতা দিবস** — Independence Day, 26 March (1971)\n- **বিজয় দিবস** — Victory Day, 16 December (1971)\n\n**দিবস** is the formal word for a named 'Day'; ordinary 'day' is **দিন**.",
